    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0<i><strong>Super Serious Golf</strong></i>\u00a0where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Terrible at golf? Great! Hit your ball as hard as you can, hope for the best and watch the madness unfold in a series of easy-to-learn minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Friendships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong>\u00a0and watch friendships fall apart. <strong>Bots can also be added\u00a0</strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in a generous amount of <strong>simple</strong>\u00a0<strong>minigames</strong>\u00a0and show off your style with a large collection of\u00a0<strong>unique hats and trails</strong>\u00a0that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, easy to understand gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots to fill out lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0<i><strong>Super Serious Golf</strong></i>\u00a0where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Terrible at golf? Great! Hit your ball as hard as you can, hope for the best and watch the madness unfold in a series of easy-to-learn minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/8c01aa3a11f9675fcf8f2503367c3f90.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Friendships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong>\u00a0and watch friendships fall apart. <strong>Bots can also be added\u00a0</strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/2f13fc8df738e746110ab943ed351e0c.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in a generous amount of <strong>simple</strong>\u00a0<strong>minigames</strong>\u00a0and show off your style with a large collection of\u00a0<strong>unique hats and trails</strong>\u00a0that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.poster.avif?t=1755592354\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.webm?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ff4daddaa5c3c14f412bee0509b688a.mp4?t=1755592354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, easy to understand gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots to fill out lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
